OCMAT 1
# M_LabMetal: a plain lab material naming the physical surface Metal.
SHADER standard
BLEND opaque
CULL back
FLAGS twosided=0 castshadow=1

PARAM baseColorFactor 0.620 0.640 0.680 1.0
PARAM metallicFactor 0.0
PARAM roughnessFactor 0.7
PARAM emissiveFactor 0.0 0.0 0.0
PARAM normalScale 1.0
PARAM occlusionStrength 1.0

PHYSSURFACE Metal
